
# Lab 04 — Windows Defender Firewall

## Objective
Inspect Windows Defender Firewall profiles and verify firewall status.

## Environment
- OS: Windows 11 Pro
- Account: BUTLERLAB\Administrator
- Tool: Windows Security

## Procedure
1. Opened Windows Security.
2. Navigated to Firewall & network protection.
3. Inspected Domain, Private, and Public network profiles.

## Findings
- Domain network firewall: On.
- Private network firewall: On.
- Public network firewall: On.

## Skills Practiced
- Windows firewall administration.
- Network security inspection.
- Firewall profile verification.

## Result
Verified that all three Windows Defender Firewall profiles were enabled.
